    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="0ba4fa7c-b39a-5c89-bafa-0666cc2994c3" activityNameId="1e823c6f-091b-55d4-948d-40a24e15ecf3" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Biogas, from agricultural digestion, not covered, at storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Biogas, from agricultural digestion, not covered, at storage
The data represent a mixed manure (50% cattle and 50% swines).  Liquid manure input is assumed to have a share of dry matter of 7.5%,  and an organic share of dry matter of 80% with a carbon content of 50%. All emissions are exclusively allocated to the installation and operation of the agricultural biogas generation.;
UUID: 871799fb-7303-3352-a899-e0eb848148cb
Data represents the in- and outpust due to liquid manure pre treatment, digestion and emissions due to the storage of digested manure that occur as a consequence of the anaerobic treatment of  manure .  Gas purification and the use of the gas for co-generation are not included.
Location: Conditions of typical swiss plant.
Technology: Mesophile digestion
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 65097 m3/a
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_871799fb-7303-3352-a899-e0eb848148cb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
